# The seed IS the identity and the airdrop address. It is not recoverable and
# not revocable.
identity/*
*.seed
*.hex

# Deliberate exception, owner's decision (2026-08-26): the recovery card, which
# CONTAINS THE SEED, is committed to the PRIVATE repo as the backup of record.
# The reasoning: the key protects nothing of value yet, and losing it to a disk
# failure is the larger risk today. If the identity becomes worth attacking, the
# hardening path is migration to a fresh key, not scrubbing this history.
# Keep this repo private. Anyone who can read it holds the identity.
!identity/RECOVERY-CARD.txt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
privacy.deny
technocore-chat/
daemon.log
.publish/
tools/__pycache__/
